{title: Maine Tere Liye Hi Saat Rang Ke}
{artist: Aanand Mukesh Salil Chowdhury}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Maine, tere liye hi,        saat rang ke sa [B]pne chune,
Sap [A]ne, surile sap [E]ne.        [E]Kuch hanste ke, kuch [A]ghum ke,
Teri [E]ankhon ke, [A]saye,        chu [B]raye, ras [A]eeli [E]yaadon ne,
[E]Chooti baatein;        [E]Chooti chooti baaton ki hai
yaadein badi,        [A]Bhoole nahin, bithi hui ek,
[B]chooti ghadi.        [E]Janam janam se, [D]aankhein bichaye,
[A]Tere liye, in [B]rahoon ne.        [E]Roothi raatein;
[E]Roothi hui raaton ko manaya kabhi,        [A]Tere liye, mithi subah ko
[B]bulaya kabhi.        [E]Roothi raatein;
[E]Roothi hui raaton ko manaya kabhi,        [A]Tere liye, mithi subah ko
[B]bulaya kabhi.        [E]Tere bina bhi, [D]tere liye hi,
[A]Diye jalaye [B]rahoon mein,        [E]Bholay bhaley;
[E]Bhole bhale dil ko behlate rahe,        [A]Tanhai mein, tere khayalon ko
sa [B]jate rahe.        [E]Bholay bhaley;
[E]Bhole bhale dil ko behlate rahe,        [A]Tanhai mein, tere khayalon ko
sa [B]jate rahe.        [E]Kabhi kabhi to, [D]aawaaz dekar,
[A]Mujhko jagaya [B]khwabon ne,
